  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>The AC circuit is shown below.</p><p><img src=\"assets\\st0128_06ca3fdd4b08.png\" style=\"width: 250px; height: 158px;\" /></p><p>Here,<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>R</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>100</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><msub><mi>X</mi><mi>L</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mi>L</mi><mi>&#969;</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>1803</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>750</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>2</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#960;</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>850</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#937;</mi></math></p><p>The capacitive reactance&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>X</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">c</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mi>C&#969;</mi></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mrow><msup><mn>10</mn><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>5</mn></mrow></msup><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>2</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#960;</mi><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>750</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>21</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>23</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#937;</mi></math></p><p>Total impedance&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Z</mi><mo>=</mo><msqrt><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">R</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mfenced><mrow><msub><mi>X</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">L</mi></msub><mo>-</mo><msub><mi>X</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi></msub></mrow></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup></msqrt></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><msqrt><msup><mn>100</mn><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mfenced><mrow><mn>850</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>21</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>23</mn></mrow></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup></msqrt><mo>=</mo><mn>834</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>77</mn><mo>&#8776;</mo><mn>835</mn></math></p><p>The heat loss&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi><mo>=</mo><msubsup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi><mi>rms</mi><mn>2</mn></msubsup><mi>Rt</mi><mo>=</mo><mfenced><mi>ms</mi></mfenced><mo>&#8710;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">t</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mn>20</mn><mn>835</mn></mfrac><mo>&#215;</mo><mfrac><mn>20</mn><mn>835</mn></mfrac><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>100</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">t</mi><mo>=</mo><mfenced><mn>2</mn></mfenced><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>10</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">t</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>348</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>61</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>sec</mi></math></p>"
